hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16128","al-Qasim ibn Malik al-Muzani Abu Jafar narrated to us, he said: Jamil ibn Zayd informed me, he said: I accompanied an old man of the Ansar who mentioned he had companionship, called Kab ibn Zayd or Zayd ibn Kab, and he narrated to me that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) married a woman from Banu Ghifar, and when he entered upon her, he put his garment and sat on the bed, and saw whiteness on her side, so he withdrew from the bed, then said: Take your clothes upon you. And he did not take anything of what he came to her."
